Package: strainspy
Type: Package
Title: Strain Level Microbiome Wide Association Studies
Version: 0.99.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Gerry", family = "Tonkin-Hill",
        role = "aut", email = "g.tonkinhill@gmail.com"),
    person(given = "Sudaraka", family = "Mallawarachchi",
        role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "smallawaarachchi@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Fits statistical models to detect microbial strains 
    associated with a phenotype. For small sample sizes, models can be fitted 
    using empirical Bayes maximum a posteriori (MAP) priors to improve detection 
    power. Supports various experimental design scenarios, including repeated 
    measures.
